sequenceDiagram
    participant proc as Process
    participant sem as Semaphore
    participant res as Shared Resource
    
    proc->>sem: sem_open("/mysem", O_CREAT, 0644, 1)
    Note over sem: Initial value = 1 (unlocked)
    
    proc->>sem: sem_wait() // P operation
    Note over sem: Decrement: 1 → 0, Acquire lock
    
    proc->>res: Access shared resource
    Note over res: Critical section, Only one process at a time
    
    proc->>sem: sem_post() // V operation
    Note over sem: Increment: 0 → 1, Release lock
    
    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over proc,res: Other processes blocked in sem_wait, until sem_post releases
    end
    
    proc->>sem: sem_close()
    proc->>sem: sem_unlink("/mysem")
    
    Note over sem: Binary semaphore (0 or 1) = Mutex, Counting semaphore (>1) = Resource pool
